  "decontamination_notes": "Real feature from python-attrs/attrs PR #1571, merged 2026-08-01, after model training cutoffs, so the specific implementation is novel. Repo sliced at the PR's base commit d2fbfcc (src/attr + src/attrs + pyproject.toml + MIT LICENSE); attrs is dependency-free, so tests run on the base sandbox image with PYTHONPATH=src. Adds a `ne` (not-equal) number validator to attr.validators. Hidden tests assert observable validator behavior via the public attrs API (accepts unequal values, raises ValueError on the forbidden value), never internal validator classes.",
